OL,3,GNEWSA'Abattoirs are in crisis state and
OL,4,Aneed support'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man who runs the last abattoir in
OL,7,FSussex has backed the National Farmers'
OL,8,FUnion's (NFU) call for better
OL,9,Fprotection for the sector which he says
OL,10,Fis in a "crisis state".
OL,12,FAccording to a joint letter, signed by
OL,13,Fthe NFU and more than 150
OL,14,Forganisations, the number of abattoirs
OL,15,Fin the UK has fallen from around 2,500
OL,16,Fin the 1970s to approximately 200
OL,17,Ftoday.
OL,19,FThis dwindling number has prompted a
OL,20,Fcall for the government to recognise
OL,21,Flocal slaughter capacity as essential
OL,22,Fnational infrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
