OL,3,GNEWSA'Abattoirs are in crisis state and
OL,4,Aneed support'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLuke Smith, from Down Land Traditional
OL,7,FMeats in Henfield, said it was an
OL,8,F"under-recognised sector" desperately
OL,9,Fin need of support.
